_:na3d122bf8e644f129bd19536b3de6d3cb2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:root defines the root against which a relative rml:path is\n        resolved: rml:CurrentWorkingDirectory, rml:MappingDirectory, or an\n        absolute path string Literal. Defaults to\n        rml:CurrentWorkingDirectory if not specified.\n        " .
