_:nfa71312961b24c35be74a359ae48a7f0b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        Exactly one rml:targetView property must be specified for each rml:InclusionAnnotation.\r\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLogicalTargetShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
