_:n0887cbb9c31b4961821d556cbe9691d6b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        Exactly one rml:fieldName property must be specified for a rml:Field, with a string as its value.\r\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLParentMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
_:nb97bebebd98f423295ad1b26516f7f16b32 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/objectMap> .
_:n3d3f8d29fd184eaf9d3dcdb4a797ec0cb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Exactly one rml:viewOn property must be specified for a rml:LogicalView, with a rml:AbstractLogicalSource as its value.\n        " .
_:nbb50cbbb20a44db288ba2019b8cd2e43b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Only one of rml:template, rml:constant, or rml:reference is allowed.\n        " .
