<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSourceShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    RML Source accepts one or multiple rml:null, one rml:compression,\n    and one rml:encoding. All of them are optional.\n    " .
_:nf7568f1a99c44c7b81a59ecf8741b7e6b2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:encoding specifies the encoding to use when accessing the data \n        source. By default, UTF-8 is used.\n        " .
_:nf7568f1a99c44c7b81a59ecf8741b7e6b10 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:nf7568f1a99c44c7b81a59ecf8741b7e6b8 .
