_:nb97bebebd98f423295ad1b26516f7f16b12 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:subject must be an IRI or blank node.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLGraphMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GraphMap" .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTermMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Term Map is an Expression Map with optionally a term type specified.\n    " .
