<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/InclusionAnnotationShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n    Node must have a valid rml:InclusionAnnotation description.\r\n    Each InclusionAnnotation annotation requires (additionally to the inherited `rml:onFields` property):\r\n    - Exactly one `rml:targetView` property\r\n    - Exactly one `rml:targetFields` property.\r\n    " .
_:nd3cff6427eed48cc9968af9745d0a168b11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:childMap must point to a rml:ChildMap specifying the\n        child of the Literal.\n        " .
