_:n5251fde3834b42b38bcdf622cb748002b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "rml:constant of a LanguageMap must be a plain string, not a language-tagged literal." .
_:ne9188c3eb9db4ccbb3d12b0f9679d191b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n        rml:referenceFormulation must be a blank node or IRI specifying the\r\n        reference formulation on how to reference elements of a data source,\r\n        and may be provided at most once.\r\n        " .
_:n7f811c4231934f1b88930def47311dfeb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
