_:n3cad4073fa7c4092b1c40c2b600a203bb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:termType for Predicate Map can only be a rml:IRI, rml:UnsafeIRI,\n        rml:URI, or rml:UnsafeURI;\n        " .
_:n7bc009c07d3a4ed5933b382ffdca4017b4 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:constant must be an IRI or Literal.\n        " .
